he latest upstream consumer group offset and the latest offset-sync topic r=
ecord's downstream offset to caculate the downstream offset:
> =C2=A0 long upstreamStep =3D upstreamOffset - offsetSync.get().upstreamOf=
fset();
> =C2=A0 return OptionalLong.of(offsetSync.get().downstreamOffset() + upstr=
eamStep);
