n't replicated to target cluster , the downstream offset will bigger than t=
opic partiton offset after consumer group offset synced to target cluster (=
the target cluster topic=C2=A0 has not active consumer).=C2=A0
> =C2=A0
> In the method syncGroupOffset of MirrorCheckpointTask class, there is no =
check for consumer group offset and topic partiton offset.
