ucer/consumer with `remote.log.metadata.producer.` and=C2=A0`remote.log.met=
adata.consumer.` prefixes. These will override properties with `remote.log.=
metadata.common.client.` prefix.{color}
{color:#000000}Any other properties should be prefixed with "remote.log.met=
adata." and these will be passed to RemoteLogMetadataManager#configure(Map<=
String, ?> props).{color}
{color:#000000}For ex: Security configuration to connect to the local broke=
r for the listener name configured are passed with props.{color}|

=C2=A0

