ravindhranath@gmail.com> wrote:

> Hello,
>
> I would like to start a discussion on KIP-933 to add new metrics to Kafka
> Connect that helps  monitoring polling failures with source connectors.
>
>
> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-933%3A+Publish+metr=
ics+when+source+connector+fails+to+poll+data
>
> Looking forward to feedback on this.
>
> Thank you,
> Ravindranath
>

