>
> With the current implementation if the follower fetches offset 0 and the =
KRaft leader has a record batch at offset 0, it will always send a FETCH re=
sponse with records.
> If the KRaft log has generated a snapshot it is always more efficient of =
the follower fetch the snapshot instead.



